// Records the suite's crosshair demo (demos/probe-dxhr.dm3), probe-crosshair's scene: on
// training, Julie wields the shotgun, which shows the crosshair, on the wall ahead and
// then on the floor. The pitch +lookdown reaches varies with frame timing, but the demo
// holds the one retail reached, so the "demo-crosshair" check sees the same view on both
// games; made on retail by refresh-retail.ps1. record needs g_syncronousClients
// (fakk2.exe 0x4201f6).
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 25
stuffcmd "give weapon_shotgun.tik"
wait 0.5
stuffcmd "use Shotgun dual"
stuffcmd "set g_syncronousClients 1"
wait 3
stuffcmd "record probe-dxhr"
wait 1
stuffcmd "+lookdown"
wait 0.25
stuffcmd "-lookdown"
wait 1.5
stuffcmd "stoprecord"
wait 0.2
stuffcmd "quit"
end
